          "R1 running-config: GigabitEthernet0/0/0 ip 192.168.0.1/24 (source LAN present).",
          "R1 routing table (running-config): route for 172.16.0.0/24 via 10.0.0.2.",
          "R2 running-config: GigabitEthernet0/0/0 ip 172.16.0.1/24 (destination LAN present).",
          "R2 routing section in running-config contains only default route (no 192.168.0.0/24 entry).",
          "OSPF is not configured on any router (ospf_full empty), so dynamic advertisement of the 192.168.0.0/24 route is not present."
        ],
        "confidence": 0.9
      }
    ],
    "missing_info": [
      "No confirmation of the host 192.168.0.13 IP/ARP presence on R1 LAN (host-level reachability/ARP).",
      "No packet-capture/flow logs to prove packets were received on R2 before dropping."
    ]
  },
  "needs_fix": true,
  "plan": {
    "plan_steps": [
      {
        "id": "step-1",
        "device": "router2",
        "action": "add_static_route",
        "target": "route 192.168.0.0/24",
